1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
When should an employee

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,180
consult a psychologist

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,920
or a psychiatrist?

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,300
Let's see.

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,380
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad,

6
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,960
a Psychologist.

7
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:13,060
How can an employee

8
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,680
know they are stressed?

9
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:19,340
If they were active earlier,

10
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:22,000
and after joining,

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,280
say within a month,

12
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,860
they start feeling dull,

13
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,340
cannot work properly,

14
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,420
cannot grasp anything assigned,

15
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,000
either sleeping too much

16
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,400
or having insomnia,

17
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,640
forgetting skills

18
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:41,340
they already know,

19
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:43,860
ignoring everything,

20
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:46,520
unable to mingle with anyone,

21
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,740
loss of appetite

22
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:51,520
or overeating,

23
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:54,340
as well as physiological issues

24
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:56,660
like severe gastritis,

25
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:58,280
constipation,

26
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,840
or other physical ailments,

27
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:04,900
which ruin concentration,

28
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:07,580
when you have these symptoms

29
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:10,360
and feel unable to work

30
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:13,500
properly at your workplace,

31
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,800
meeting a counselor

32
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:18,440
and taking timely counseling

33
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:21,360
will help you recover easily

34
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:23,740
and become a great employee.

35
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:26,000
Thank you.

